#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid "You can modify the Weathermap Node from here.  The Position columns are the X,Y position on the Map.  The Internal Name is the unique ID given to the Node.  The Label is the external name of the Node that you provide to users.  The Icon Filename is the Graphic that you want to represent the Node Object.  The INFO URL is a link that you can provide when clicking on the active Map Node.  The Hover Graph URL's are Cacti or other Graphs URL's that can will appear when hovering over the Node.  The Graph Selector is a helper for selecting Cacti Graphs for the Graph URL's.   There are several other Node properties possible.  However, today we are only supporting those included above."
msgstr "Ushobora guhindura Ipfundo rya Weathermap uvuye hano.  Inkingi z'Umwanya ni imirongo ngenderwaho ya X,Y ku Ikarita.  Izina ry'Imbere ni ID yihariye ihabwa Ipfundo.  Ikirango ni izina ryo hanze ry'Ipfundo uha abakoresha.  Izina rya Dosiye y'Agashushanyo ni ishusho ushaka ko ihagararira Ipfundo.  INFO URL ni ihuza ushobora gutanga iyo ukanze ku Ipfundo rikora ku Ikarita.  URL z'Ibishushanyo Bigaragara Uhagazeho ni URL z'Ibishushanyo bya Cacti cyangwa ibindi bishobora kugaragara iyo uhagaze hejuru y'Ipfundo.  Umuhitamo w'Igishushanyo ni igikoresho gifasha guhitamo Ibishushanyo bya Cacti kuri URL z'Ibishushanyo.   Hari ibindi biranga byinshi by'Ipfundo bishoboka.  Ariko uyu munsi dushyigikiye gusa ibikubiye haruguru."

