#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Ubushobozi bw'umuyoboro:</strong> Shyiraho ubushobozi bukoreshwa mu kubara ikoreshwa, urugero 100M cyangwa 1G. K, M, G na T birashyigikiwe. Hitamo Bihuye na &quot;In&quot; iyo ibyerekezo byombi bifite ubushobozi bungana.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Interifasi y'urujya n'uruza:</strong> Shakisha ukoresheje igikoresho, icyambu cyangwa ibisobanuro, cyangwa uhitemo Shakira muri byose. Hitamo interifasi, hanyuma ukande Koresha interifasi kugira ngo ushyireho isoko ry'ibanze ryapimwe, aho ujya ukanze n'igishushanyo gikuru kigaragara uhagazeho. Amasoko y'inyongera yapimwe n'ibishushanyo bigaragara uhagazeho biragumishwa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Imigaragarire n'ibitekerezo:</strong> Imigaragarire ya Via igenzura amakoni agondamye cyangwa afite imfuruka; Ubugari bw'Ihuza bugenzura umubyimba w'umwambi. Igitekerezo cya IN n'Igitekerezo cya OUT byongeraho umwandiko kuri buri cyerekezo. Ijanisha rigena umwanya w'umwandiko ku burebure bw'ihuza. Imigaragarire y'Igitekerezo ishyira ibitekerezo iruhande rw'ihuza (Ku mpande) cyangwa hejuru y'umwambi (Hagati); Koresha mburabuzi y'ikarita ikurikiza Imigaragarire y'Ikarita.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ibishushanyo by'inyongera bigaragara uhagazeho:</strong> Erekana ibishushanyo bitarenze bibiri bigaragara uhagazeho: igishushanyo gikuru cy'urujya n'uruza n'ikindi kimwe cy'inyongera, nka CPU, ubukererwe cyangwa indi nterifasi. Yungurura ukurikije ubwoko bw'igishushanyo bigabanya amahitamo. Ongeraho igishushanyo kigaragara uhagazeho yongeraho icy'inyongera; Simbura ibishushanyo bigaragara uhagazeho iragihindura; Kuramo igishushanyo iragikuramo. Igishushanyo gikuru cy'urujya n'uruza, urujya n'uruza rwapimwe n'aho ujya ukanze ku ihuza biguma bitahindutse. Mu irebero, buri gishushanyo cya Cacti gifungura igishushanyo cyacyo cyuzuye iyo gikanzweho.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Amagenamiterere yisumbuye:</strong> Ibigenzura bitari itegeko byo kwimura ibirango by'urujya n'uruza bya IN/OUT, guhuza amasoko yapimwe, guhindura aho ujya ukanze no kwinjiza URL zihariye z'amashusho agaragara uhagazeho. Imyanya y'ibirango by'urujya n'uruza yimura udusanduku tw'ikoreshwa ku burebure bw'ihuza, bitagendeye ku myanya y'ibitekerezo. Koresha mburabuzi y'ikarita ikurikiza Imigaragarire y'Ikarita. Ihuza risanzwe ry'urujya n'uruza ubusanzwe ntirikenera impinduka hano.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Guhuza amasoko y'urujya n'uruza:</strong> Ongeraho isoko ry'urujya n'uruza yongeraho indi nterifasi ku giteranyo cy'ikarita, ukwabyo kuri IN na OUT. Kuramo isoko ikuramo isoko ry'inyongera. Hindura isoko ry'ibanze ukoresheje Koresha interifasi hejuru. Urujya n'uruza ruhurijwe hamwe rugereranywa n'ubushobozi bw'umuyoboro bwagenwe kugira ngo habarwe ikoreshwa. Nta gishushanyo giteranyije cya Cacti gihangwa ku buryo bwikora; hanga igishushanyo giteranyije gihuye muri Cacti kandi winjize URL zacyo zo gukandaho no kureba uhagazeho niba bikenewe. Amahuza atandukanye ku ikarita ubusanzwe asobanutse neza ku mahuza y'ibanze n'ay'ubufasha.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Amasoko na URL byanditswe n'intoki:</strong> Agasanduku k'umwandiko k'isoko gahindura urutonde rwose rw'amasoko yapimwe, harimo n'isoko ry'ibanze. URL y'aho ujya ukanze igenzura aho gukanda ku ihuza ry'ikarita bikujyana. URL nkuru y'igishushanyo kigaragara uhagazeho igena igishushanyo cya mbere; URL z'igishushanyo cy'inyongera yemera URL imwe y'ishusho y'inyongera. Iyi y'inyongera nayo icungirwa munsi ya Ibishushanyo by'inyongera bigaragara uhagazeho.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tunganya na Via:</strong> Tunganya igorora imiterere y'ihuza. Via igufasha gushyira akadomo ko guhindura icyerekezo ku ikarita.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Hindura Igenamiterere ry'Umwimerere:</strong> Hindura imiterere y'ikarita mu buryo butaziguye ku magenamiterere arenze iyi fishi.</p>"

